@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="card shadow-sm border-0 p-4">

    <h2 class="mb-3">
        Privacy Policy 🔒
    </h2>

    <p>
        <strong>HR Payroll System</strong> stores only the data required
        to operate attendance, leave management and payroll services.
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>
            <strong>Account data:</strong>
            Your email and securely hashed password are stored.
            Passwords are never stored in plain text.
        </li>

        <li>
            <strong>Work data:</strong>
            Attendance records, leave requests and salary information
            are accessible only to you and authorized users.
        </li>

        <li>
            <strong>Ownership:</strong>
            Employees can view only their own attendance, leave balances
            and payslips. Access is enforced through application
            authorization.
        </li>

        <li>
            <strong>Role-based access:</strong>
            Administrators, HR, Managers and Employees have different
            permissions based on their assigned roles.
        </li>

        <li>
            <strong>No selling of data:</strong>
            Your personal and payroll information is not sold to
            third parties.
        </li>

        <li>
            <strong>Secrets safety:</strong>
            System credentials and sensitive configuration are stored
            outside the source code using secure configuration
            mechanisms such as User Secrets.
        </li>
    </ul>

    <hr />

    <p class="text-muted mb-0">
        If you have questions about your data or privacy,
        please contact your system administrator.
    </p>

</div>